===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-|theosophies}}

# {{religion}} any of doctrines of religious philosophy and mysticism, claiming that knowledge of [[God]] can be attained through [[mystical]] [[insight]], spiritual ecstasy and that direct communication with [[transcendent]] world is possible

